  "_comment": "Reviewed rules for the offline MT draft service (app/mt_engine.py). de_abbreviations are expanded in German source text before translation; only unambiguous, case-sensitive abbreviations belong here (lowercase 'v.a.' means 'vor allem' and is deliberately absent). de_terms are German terms the models drop or mistranslate; they are masked and replaced by the fixed rendering for the target language (base form, grammatical case not adapted). repairs replace documented mistranslations in target text (mainly for the unmasked fallback); 'source' limits a repair to segments whose German source matches. Repair and source patterns are case-insensitive; abbreviation and term patterns are case-sensitive. Every entry must be covered by tests/test_mt_engine.py.",
